  "name": "Analyze CrowdStrike detections",
  "description": "Pulls a list of new CrowdStrike Detections, flags them as in progress in CrowdStrike, and gets the detection details for each one.\n\nFor each detection, the individual behaviors are examined, and the process hash is checked in VirusTotal to see if it is known malicious.\n\nWhere there is a provided IOC as part of the behavior, this is also checked in VirusTotal.\n\nA Jira ticket is created for each Detection, and a message sent to a Slack Channel. ",
